    {
      "id": "e6eed13d-28a5-4ddd-a5e4-38312bfe5172",
      "title": "Escute as formas curtas e observe o que muda entre eu, você e nós.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "2917ab19-abb0-4023-a2e7-231169f79e01",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute as formas mais úteis desta aula.</p><ul><li><strong>voy a</strong> para eu</li><li><strong>vas a</strong> para você</li><li><strong>vamos a</strong> para nós</li></ul><p>O trecho <strong>a + infinitivo</strong> continua igual. O que muda é a forma do verbo <strong>ir</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/9e9548c2c53b4a8db3a89a38ab1f1702_b04-voy-a-vas-a-vamos-a.mp3?Expires=1794099509&Signature=clRTpMpMiGSMEfZj2TRLwcLwTXzKYlx7l2TM90JObhT6IFqVRnPKlN3JlCcDCNWpmQpgecsEGSm5-YXJYHSILMGW58ODEqXE4dEhbYdz9x-YbKT5LjM~KXFep95EGXqTrU4tXVwRN4U57IDMBqKcuwVEhxgsrfZq462CpfXHRAJaNyz6zU4O7pPg5Wsei32SdycVh8dgdTtkTNyf~PPhAvE-dESU26hy1RDKMMt49ZEQpxfbdeN9nguMVDOw3oOC8izvF0jJ0E9Hgx3vvh~TA40TONBErEHgrq8x638mgF546RnGzdj7iacg2PEroFakt09zWyjhAD~haHr9vmjXQw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
